#: templates/views/pages/conceptual-model.htm:5
msgid ""
"The ManuSpectrum data model: an event-centric CIDOC-CRM / CRMsci description"
" of manuscripts, analyses and inferred knowledge."
msgstr ""
"The ManuSpectrum data model: an event-centric CIDOC-CRM / CRMsci description"
" of manuscripts, analyses and inferred knowledge."

#: templates/views/pages/conceptual-model.htm:10
msgid "A model for scientific manuscript description"
msgstr "A model for scientific manuscript description"

#: templates/views/pages/conceptual-model.htm:12
msgid ""
"The object, the analyses applied to it, and the knowledge inferred from them"
" — formalised with a shared ontology (CIDOC-CRM + CRMsci) for interoperable,"
" reusable data within the Biblissima+ ecosystem. The approach is event-"
"centric: it tracks production, sampling, analysis, characterization, "
"alteration and modification, and keeps observed facts distinct from "
"inferences while preserving source attribution."
msgstr ""
"The object, the analyses applied to it, and the knowledge inferred from them"
" — formalised with a shared ontology (CIDOC-CRM + CRMsci) for interoperable,"
" reusable data within the Biblissima+ ecosystem. The approach is event-"
"centric: it tracks production, sampling, analysis, characterization, "
"alteration and modification, and keeps observed facts distinct from "
"inferences while preserving source attribution."

