#: templates/views/pages/team.htm:12
msgid ""
"ManuSpectrum is developed within Cluster 2 — “Consideration and "
"searchability of materials-analysis data” — of the ANR Biblissima+ "
"programme, at the Centre de Recherche sur la Conservation (CRC), in "
"partnership with Huma-Num. It archives, standardises and makes searchable "
"the physicochemical analysis of manuscripts and written heritage, so that "
"non-specialists can reuse reliable, interoperable data."
msgstr ""
"ManuSpectrum is developed within Cluster 2 — “Consideration and "
"searchability of materials-analysis data” — of the ANR Biblissima+ "
"programme, at the Centre de Recherche sur la Conservation (CRC), in "
"partnership with Huma-Num. It archives, standardises and makes searchable "
"the physicochemical analysis of manuscripts and written heritage, so that "
"non-specialists can reuse reliable, interoperable data."

#: templates/views/pages/team.htm:15
msgid "Read more"
msgstr "Read more"

#: templates/views/pages/team.htm:16
msgid ""
"Built on Arches, ManuSpectrum places the material component at the pivot "
"between the object, its context, the analyses and their interpretations, "
"using shared ontologies (CIDOC-CRM, CRMsci) and reference thesauri to keep "
"heterogeneous documents comparable and interoperable with the Biblissima "
"portal."
msgstr ""
"Built on Arches, ManuSpectrum places the material component at the pivot "
"between the object, its context, the analyses and their interpretations, "
"using shared ontologies (CIDOC-CRM, CRMsci) and reference thesauri to keep "
"heterogeneous documents comparable and interoperable with the Biblissima "
"portal."

